B.auW=s(["Tap a quest to read its instructions, then complete it to earn XP based on its rank. Leveling up advances your title and increases your HP and available Ability Points (AP).","Daily quests are for the current day; Main and Side quests remain on the board until completed. Daily quests can be assigned to the weekdays you choose.","Complete at least one quest in a day to build or maintain your streak. Cleared quests play the System\u2019s check-and-burn effect.","Use Missions to view your progression roadmap, Guild to see its schedule, and Reward Shop to exchange earned rank tokens for rewards.","The drawer also contains Notes, History, Summary reports, Theme, Mail, account controls, and your optional Goal Doc link."],t.s)
B.b2O=new A.kk(B.lH,"LABYRINTH","Turn daily goals into quests and Monarch progression.",B.o,B.auW)
