B.aIw=s(["Your progress is saved on this device as you use the app. Sign in with Google, email, or an anonymous profile.","Choose Sync in the Labyrinth drawer to upload this device\u2019s current progress, including quests, profile, Nutrition, Notes, Library, and Theme. Wait for the success message before switching devices.","To continue on another device, sign in with the same account there. An anonymous profile is separate from your Google or email account.","If you are offline, changes remain on this device until a sync can complete. A sync failure message means the upload was not confirmed.","Set a title and link for your Goal Doc in Settings, then open it from the drawer. System Mail keeps app notices and player reminders."],t.s)
